{
  "work_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom",
  "source_path": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0013",
      "source_sha256": "9cf8d41c3438e4df",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "What does the furnace do to gold? It purifies it even more."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0034",
      "source_sha256": "21086c990bad4be0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "When a robber is caught stealing, he is ashamed. The tax collector, however, is brazen as he plunders."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0051",
      "source_sha256": "1558747df3229e9e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "Art came in and fashioned all creation into a [?] form."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0069",
      "source_sha256": "7438e9902551deaf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "When I [?], I ran to the Spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0120",
      "source_sha256": "469a0ece51d7e37c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "Will you not, then, leave the inhabited world desolate—the Scythians, the Arabs, the Elamites, Cilicia, Cappadocia, the Syrians, the people of Phoenicia, and every place on which the sun shines?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0122",
      "source_sha256": "7dc5014b7fcc5165",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "And will you leave the nations desolate as well?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0157",
      "source_sha256": "051dae45592f5077",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "Set your soul at the door. Do not withdraw until you receive what you ask for."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0164",
      "source_sha256": "9a8f4e5a253daf3c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "When Daniel was in the lions’ den, God helped him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0165",
      "source_sha256": "ced64a8f99ba24e4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "The three holy men, while in the furnace, found God and pleaded with him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0166",
      "source_sha256": "02056b62b4e41d3e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "Job, while on the dung heap among the worms, found God and called upon him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0167",
      "source_sha256": "37a9852f52daec72",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "You too, if you call upon him, he will hear you in your prayer."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0168",
      "source_sha256": "f3c59c7f0ed58c7a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "Make yourself like this Canaanite woman."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0170",
      "source_sha256": "0a37a98ced447b8d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "And look, a long time has passed since she died, yet the honor of her memory endures, bringing forth glory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0171",
      "source_sha256": "01384f758f1d7967",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "Even if you do not have a demon-possessed daughter, you do have your soul, which is sinning."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0172",
      "source_sha256": "7d893e845ba7bbb7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "He has mercy on the demon-possessed person, but he hates the one who sins."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0173",
      "source_sha256": "83f8b7838d46bd94",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "A demon-possessed person is not held accountable, but the one who sins has no defense."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.000.0174",
      "source_sha256": "bf3ef33e9f13100f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "When did the Canaanite woman cast out the demon?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.001.0016",
      "source_sha256": "d23cda6580628bbd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "And now, then, we too open our hearts in purity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.001.0054",
      "source_sha256": "6a795a7dba4fdf11",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "And she sent her servants out to bring her soap and oil."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.001.0080",
      "source_sha256": "fc185bc362814abf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "We have been entrusted with the law and the authority to loose and bind in every matter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.001.0090",
      "source_sha256": "20fa1e7c41c28553",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "A sorrow for her neighbors and the people of her household."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.001.0103",
      "source_sha256": "983ce189db95111f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "Do not think, then, that I will be afraid of you and obey you and defile my chastity."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "patristic/coptic-scriptorium/pseudo_chrysostom#CopScr.pseudo-chrysostom.001.0107",
      "source_sha256": "1822d94dbda85cb8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 23,
      "text": "I will not untie the knot of my marriage while I am bound to him by it."
    }
  ]
}
